  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Decommissioning of MILF Combatants and Weapons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Decommissionoing Process of the Moro Islamic Liberation Front&apos;s Combatants and Weapons, according to the 2014 Comprehensive Agreement on the Bangsamoro. The grant covers the international efforts to support the DDR framework, specifically on staff-related costs, operational expenses and competence-buildling to support the decommissioning process.</narrative>
  </description>
